== Walkthrough ==

Collier may be found at (-1170, -70, 83) in [[Erudin]], on the top floor of the Vasty Deep Inn.

You say, 'Hail, Collier' 

: Collier says 'Make it a habit of walking into peoples rooms now do ya? Well seeing as I'm here on business I may have a [proposition] for you.' 

You say, 'What is the proposition?'

: ''If your faction is too low:''

: Collier says 'You need to prove your dedication to our cause before I can discuss such matters with you.'

: ''If your faction is high enough ''(indifferent)'':''

: Collier says 'I'm in the employment of an alchemist that desires some rare venom from this region of Norrath. I will reward you with a special weapon treatment if you can return to me with a venomous spikefish poison sac, an ancient poison sac, an ancient snake fang, and the blood of a necromancer.' 

You say, 'What special weapon treatment?'

: Collier says 'My employer has uncovered the secrets of the Bloodclaw and can reproduce the weapon treatment used in the forging of the legendary Stiletto of the Bloodclaw.'

He wants:

<ol>
<li>[[Ancient Snake Fang]] - drops off [[Slyder the Ancient]] in [[Stonebrunt Mountains]]</li>
<li>[[Ancient Venom Sack]] - drops off [[Slyder the Ancient]] in [[Stonebrunt Mountains]]</li>
<li>[[Venomous Spikefish Poison Sac]] - extremely rare drop off [[Venomous Spikefish]] in [[Kerra Island]]</li>
<li>[[Necromancer Blood]] - drops off [[Heretic Invader]]s in [[Stonebrunt Mountains]]</li>
</ol>

Collier gives back a [[Thick Caustic Liquid]] which is tradeable, along with the text reply to the effect of:  "There is the weapon treatment I promised you.  Use it in a forge with any standard forged weapon.  Choose your preferred weapon carefully as there is only enough of the substance for a single treatment."
: Collier says, 'Here is the weapon treatment that I have promised you. Use it with any standard forged weapon. Choose your preferred weapon carefully as there is only enough of the substance for a single treatment.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Circle of Unseen Hands]] has been adjusted by 2
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Qeynos]] has been adjusted by -1
* Your faction standing with [[Corrupt Qeynos Guards]] has been adjusted by 1
* Your faction standing with [[Guards of Qeynos]] has been adjusted by -1
* Your faction standing with [[Kane Bayle]] has been adjusted by 1
{{exp}}
</div>

(Collier then despawns)


The reward varies depending upon which weapon you use:

* [[Forged Battle Axe]] yields [[Bloodclaw Battle Axe]].
* [[Forged Dagger]] yields [[Bloodclaw Dagger]].
* [[Forged Long Sword]] yields [[Bloodclaw Long Sword]]. (This is the best ratio)
* [[Forged Mace]] yields [[Bloodclaw Mace]] - (The Mace is not a MAGIC item, and as a result, inferior to the others.)
* [[Forged Rapier]] yields [[Bloodclaw Rapier]].
* [[Forged Scimitar]] yields [[Bloodclaw Scimitar]]. (Druid usable)

Weapons that do not work:

* [[Forged Warhammer]] does not work.

